            "title_2": "30-Day Free Returns & Exchanges",
            "desc_2": "<p>Not completely in love with your new tech accessory? We’ve got you covered. We offer a hassle-free, 30-day <strong>free return and exchange</strong> policy for any reason. Simply keep the product in its original condition and contact our team to start a smooth refund or exchange process. Please see our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">return policy</a> for more details.</p>",
            "icon_2": "tag",
            "title_3": "12-Month Worry-Free Warranty",
            "desc_3": "<p>We stand behind the quality and craftsmanship of our products. Every RORRY charger is protected by a <strong>12-month worry-free warranty</strong> against manufacturing defects. Want longer protection? Register your product on our <a href=\"/pages/activate-warranty\" title=\"Activate Warranty\">warranty activation page</a> to extend your coverage to <strong>18 months</strong> for ultimate peace of mind.</p>",
            "icon_3": "shield",
            "title_4": "Lifetime Customer Support",
            "desc_4": "<p>We’re always here for you. Whether you have questions about device compatibility, fast-charging protocols, or order tracking, our dedicated support team is ready to assist. Reach out to us anytime at <a href=\"mailto:hello@domain.com\">support@rorry.com</a> and expect a friendly response within <strong>12-24 hours</strong> on business days.</p>",
